          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "A vivid blue-colored mantis. It lives not only in grassy areas, but by the seaside as well. They are triggered by any sudden movements, and are known to ferociously eat even their own kind without an ounce of remorse when their environment lacks their means of sustenance. Those who have witnessed this terrifying image fear this beast may be a demon, and have thus come to call it the mantis devil."
